      "html": "<section class=\"slide t-cream\">\n  <div class=\"chr-page\">02 / 08</div>\n  <div style=\"margin:auto 0\">\n    <div class=\"chr-kicker\">Chapter 01</div>\n    <h1 class=\"chr-title\">The <span style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Problem</span>.</h1>\n    <span class=\"chr-divider\"></span>\n    <p class=\"chr-sub\">Token 上限是一个物理事实。你每次和 LLM 说话，它都是一个失忆症患者。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chr-footer\"><span>chapter · 01 / 04</span><span>section</span></div>\n</section>"
