      "html": "<section class=\"slide t-slate\">\n  <div class=\"chr-page\">05 / 08</div>\n  <div style=\"margin:auto 0\">\n    <div class=\"chr-kicker\">Minimal Setup</div>\n    <h2 class=\"chr-heading\" style=\"font-size:72px;letter-spacing:-2px\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent)\">4 行</span> YAML<br>就能开始。</h2>\n    <pre class=\"chr-codebox\">memory:\n  root: ~/.llm-wiki\n  format: markdown\n  retrieval: hybrid  # embedding + bm25</pre>\n    <p class=\"chr-sub\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:20px\">你现在拥有一个会随时间增长的 <strong>第二大脑</strong>。每次对话它都会被读、被更新。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chr-footer\"><span>content · code</span><span>05</span></div>\n</section>"
